ther. I have to bless my brother. I have to bless my people. Why is the world so evil?"}, {"start": "00:13:00", "end": "00:13:31", "text": "You are listening to FBi 94.5. Myself, Johnny Lieu, coming to you from unceded Gadigaland here in Redfern. You are listening to Dot Zip on Saturday Sunset. This one playing on us right now earlier this year on Rhythm Section, Isaac Carter, Callum Aza with Understand. De Niro featuring Pee Wavy, the Stand the Man remix by Isco, and starting off the show, Phyllis Jackson with Get It Junior. Thank you."}, {"start": "00:13:42", "end": "00:14:10", "text": "I'm going to keep it pretty light and housey for the first hour and a bit of the show and then we'll see how we go from there. Hope you are having a lovely evening. What are you up to if you're doing things for Halloween? Yeah, you can also get in touch with me on 0435 123 945. That's 0435 123 945. It's FBi Radio 94.5."}, {"start": "01:31:49", "end": "01:32:28", "text": "Saturday Sunset on FBi 94.5. Myself, Johnny Lieu, taking you through till 8pm. Hope you're having a lovely Halloween, whatever you're getting up to. This track under us, Black's Equation by Acemo and Swami Sound. F1 Shifty, Ooster Tool before that. And Addison Groove with Type Shit. That one is on Pineapple Records. Got another about half an hour with me. If you want to text in, 0435 123 945 is the number. That's 0435 123 945. Thank you to everyone who has texted in. This is FBR Radio 94.5."}], "fbi_json": [{"timestamp": {"enabled": true, "formatted": "00:00:00"}, "track": {"title": "When House Was House (feat. Mariechan & JNR (SA)) ) )", "artists": [{"name": "Mobi Dixon"}]}, "isPremiere": false, "_confidence": "mid"}, {"timestamp": {"enabled": true, "formatted": "00:03:00"}, "track": {"title": "Depp and Vrillan", "artists": [{"name": "Robots For What"}]}, "isPremiere": false, "_confidence": "low"}, {"timestamp": {"enabled": true, "formatted": "00:05:22"}, "track": {"title": "Ossumba", "artists": [{"name": "Bomel"}